 tex=[r'\section*{S33. Completed existing-schedule supplementary evaluation}',r'This extension uses the same source-selected GSO100 and native MV-Adapter interface. Four existing fixed/temporal/linear profiles were frozen before their outputs, after native/mean/late and auxiliary-correction results had been inspected. No new algorithm, model training or parameter search is involved. The main comparison follows the previous native50 question: middle-high minus fixed mean on all-six-view FG-PSNR, with three seeds averaged within object. Other83 pair/metric endpoints use Holm83; the21 nonreference LPIPS pairs use a separate exploratory Holm21 family. These families do not imply one overall experiment-wide error guarantee. The extension is external sensitivity, not pristine held-out confirmation.',r'\begin{table}[ht]\centering\small\begin{tabular}{lrrrr}\toprule Schedule & FG-PSNR & FG-LPIPS & FG-SSIM & $\Delta E_{00}$ \\\midrule']
